        "tree_id": "2e991f5dbe11412a2f38bbf490546b8caa42ebca",
        "message": "Test this app: acceptance cases derived from the spec, run by the existing engine\n\nA composed app's spec and seed rows become acceptance cases with no\nmodel call (home page and sidebar, navigation to each page, KPI figures\nwith the exact seeded count, tables listing a named seeded row and\nnarrowing on search, charts and lists rendering, custom sections free of\nerror boxes, unknown routes). They are stored as one requirement per app\nin the Test Suite's own collection, and the Deployed view's \"Test this\napp\" opens Test Execution with that requirement and the deployed URL\npreselected, closing the build-to-verify loop with the browser engine\nthat already exists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYcffsRwcYE3b46A5x4a2o",
